            "description": "<p>Your bag isn’t feeling too good? You’ve come to the right place.<br/><br/>At Crumpler, we design and make bags that last. Along with fun design, durability and function are paramount in our selection of materials and hardware. We understand the crushing pain of when your bag stops bagging, which is why we step in to repair our bags and keep them out of landfill.<br/><br/>How we take care of your bag:<br/><br/>1. We will fix any genuine manufacturing defects for FREE. If unexpectedly your hardware fails, zips stop zipping, or stitching comes undone, our repairs team will assess the issue and if it’s a defect, the repair is on us.<br/><br/>2. While everyday wear and tear or accidental damage isn’t covered as a manufacturing fault, no matter the age of your bag our repair team can fix just about anything for a reasonable FEE. Like good filler, we can get your bag looking plump again. <br/><br/><strong>Get the bag rolling!</strong><br/>If you're around Melbourne (Australia VIC 3000), bring your bag into <a href=\"https://share.google/9HvqRYiI2VuL9flhw\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://share.google/9HvqRYiI2VuL9flhw\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BAG SPA</span></a>, point to where it hurts and our skilled repairs team can take care of the rest. Or submit a <a href=\"https://wkf.ms/4ou7qLt\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wkf.ms/4ou7qLt\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">REPAIR REQUEST FORM</span></a><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> </span>and our team will assess what you need, and get back to you with the next course of action.<br/><br/>Please note we only assess repairs via our Repair Request Form, or in person at Bag Spa.</p>"
